# StartPadel — base

- Stack: React + Vite + TS + Tailwind + shadcn (Base UI) + Lucide + TanStack Query + RHF + Yup + `@xyflow/react` + dagre.
- Codigo en **ingles**. UI / validaciones / errores en **espanol**.
- UX: lenguaje de club/jugador — nunca enums tecnicos (`MATCH_WINNER`, `GROUP_POSITION`).
- Imports con `@/`. Componente unico → `export default`. Barrels → named exports.
- Naming: componentes/tipos `PascalCase`; vars/fns `camelCase`; hooks `useX.ts`; screens en `src/screens/club|users|entry`; dominio reutilizable en `src/components/`.
- Forms: RHF + `yupResolver` + `mode: "onChange"`; submit `disabled={isSubmitting || !isValid}`; `FormProvider` si hay context hijos.
- Theme default: **light** (no dark automatico). Marca: acento lima + navy; sidebar club navy (ver `look-and-feel`). Capas/UI: rules `architecture-and-organization`, `screens-and-components` y `look-and-feel`.
